# Line endings are decided here, not by each clone's core.autocrlf: text is stored AND checked out
# with LF everywhere, so byte-exact fixtures, content-addressed scripts, shell scripts (a CR breaks
# `#!/usr/bin/env bash`) and tests that split on "\n" behave alike. `eol=lf` overrides core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never converted, never merged or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
